{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578240/extras/3f7f178674a3b41e7f57a6cd7c8eccc6.poster.avif?t=1770296122\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578240/extras/3f7f178674a3b41e7f57a6cd7c8eccc6.webm?t=1770296122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2035, you're not a soldier, explorer, or hero \u2014 you're entertainment.\u00a0<strong><i>Passion Rift</i></strong>\u00a0drops you into the world\u2019s biggest reality show, where fantasy races, corporate conspiracies, and interdimensional horrors collide \u2014 along with temptation, rivalry, and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious portal has opened on a tropical island in the Seychelles. Bought for billions and transformed into a luxury resort and broadcast hub, the island is now the heart of <strong><i>Passion Rift</i></strong>\u00a0\u2014 a deadly show where participants venture into alien dimensions searching for fame, treasure, thrills\u2026 and maybe a little pleasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of years ago, the portal first touched our world, merging realms and races. Now elves take selfies, goblins shop online, and orcs argue on forums. But stepping through the Rift still means danger, glory... and cameras rolling \u2014 even when the lights go down.<br>Every step is filmed. Every decision has a cost</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578240/extras/1c8b5e24e8c40568ad8a53c8527db198.poster.avif?t=1770296122\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578240/extras/1c8b5e24e8c40568ad8a53c8527db198.webm?t=1770296122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Reality show survival</strong>\u00a0\u2013 compete, progress, and become a global star\u2026 or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Explore alien worlds</strong>\u00a0\u2013 dangerous dimensions filled with monsters, tech, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Character progression</strong>\u00a0\u2013 unlock skills, gear, perks, and rise to global fame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Idle combat</strong>\u00a0\u2013 assemble your squad and let them battle through waves of enemies using unique skills and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Flirt system</strong>\u00a0\u2013 build bonds, unlock dialogues, and collect sexy outfits for each girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate intrigue</strong>\u00a0\u2013 uncover the dark truth behind the portal and the show's creators.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578240/extras/be95d87a9258524aade916e21713f3ba.poster.avif?t=1770296122\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578240/extras/be95d87a9258524aade916e21713f3ba.webm?t=1770296122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 18 girls from all over the world \u2014 and from wildly different fantasy races \u2014 have joined the show alongside you. Elves, goblins, orcs, mutants and more, each with unique looks, outfits, and personalities \u2014 from shy to dominant, sweet to chaotic.<br>Form bonds through choices, gifts, and flirty banter. Unlock private scenes and stylish and revealing outfits. Some might want your heart. Others just want a taste of the spotlight \u2014 or you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your relationships might just help you survive\u2026 or complicate everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will they fall for your charm \u2014 or leave you behind?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Jump\u2019s Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/46d95618c182a1df4e0ea3b76cd80b4f6eebbb1d.jpg"},{"name":"Portal Tourist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/46d95618c182a1df4e0ea3b76cd80b4f6eebbb1d.jpg"},{"name":"Wanderlust Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/46d95618c182a1df4e0ea3b76cd80b4f6eebbb1d.jpg"},{"name":"Dimensional Royalty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/46d95618c182a1df4e0ea3b76cd80b4f6eebbb1d.jpg"},{"name":"Box from the Beach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/412fde6a969bca1e333f4120bbd125bf1445f483.jpg"},{"name":"Exotic Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/412fde6a969bca1e333f4120bbd125bf1445f483.jpg"},{"name":"Parallel Vault Opener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/412fde6a969bca1e333f4120bbd125bf1445f483.jpg"},{"name":"Influencer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/c0d1890b4306f82a65739ad740e5590fed84da69.jpg"},{"name":"Dimensional Trendsetter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/c0d1890b4306f82a65739ad740e5590fed84da69.jpg"},{"name":"God of the Algorithm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578240/c0d1890b4306f82a65739ad740e5590fed84da69.jpg"}],"total":18},"backgrou